		<Img src="./image/bloom2a.jpg" alt="A graph showing the relationship between the amount of stamen and petals with photos of real flowers" />
		<Caption>Mapping of the relationship between amount of stamen (reproductive organ) and petals was important initial step that provided us with inspiration for the rules of growth of parametric flowers</Caption>
	</Figure>
	<Figure>
		<Img src="./image/bloom2b.jpg" alt="A graph with illustrations of generated flowers inspired by the flowers in the first graph" />
		<Caption>The findings were translated into virtual flower concepts</Caption>
	</Figure>
</Diptych>

